Prefer using SourceKit-LSP information for Swift navigation.
Use symbol definitions instead of text search.
Before refactoring functions, check references across modules.

Swift coding guidelines:

Prefer:
- value types (struct)
- immutability
- async/await
- Result types for error handling

Avoid:
- force unwraps
- force casts
- large UIViewControllers

Prefer dependency injection for services.